# Backend Standards

- NestJS + TypeScript strict; ESLint/Prettier; semicolons.
- Thin controllers; validated DTOs; services hold use-cases.
- Prisma repositories; transactions for stock, payments, contract activation.
- Derive tenant from auth context; never trust body tenant_id.
- Swagger on public endpoints; version under `/api/v1`.
- BullMQ for async jobs; idempotent consumers.
- Providers behind ports in `*/adapters` (payments, OCR, e-sign, `MdmProviderPort`, `AndroidProvisioningPort`). Do not put DevicePolicyManager semantics in the Apple adapter.
- Log with requestId; redact national IDs and document contents.
